@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] streamed-review-ownership
The primary listening page MUST use one ordinary HTML audio player and bounded
pre-rendered encoded examples. It MUST NOT construct an AudioContext, batch-fetch
WAVs or decode/synthesize audio on selection. No media MUST load before a user
chooses an example. Repeat MUST reuse the same media URL and cacheable bytes.
Stop, superseding selection and leaving the visible page MUST pause owned media;
a stale playback rejection MUST NOT change a newer selection's status. Raw and
individual clips MUST remain optional and paginated. Browser previews MUST NOT
claim that candidate sounds are installed or accepted in the game.
